{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o023a","title":"于禁围昌豨受降以围后降法斩旧友迁虎威将军","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o023a-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"于禁围昌豨受降以围后降法斩旧友迁虎威将军","evidence":["zhangle-e-o023a-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-a-p004-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为囚送昌豨不违军令，批评于禁不顾旧交而好杀。","evidence":["zhangle-q-p004-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0162","role":"受降处斩","evidence":["zhangle-e-o023a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0151","role":"降而被斩","evidence":["zhangle-e-o023a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"论事","evidence":["zhangle-e-o023a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"冀州平后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o023a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o023a-q","source_order":[17,76,"O023a"],"order":3530}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0151","name":"昌豨","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0162","name":"于禁","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o023a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-44c775ef4d6017a4554c","layer":"original","quote":"冀州平。昌豨复叛，遣禁征之。禁急进攻豨；豨与禁有旧，诣禁降。诸将皆以为豨已降，当送诣太祖。禁曰：“诸君不知公常令乎〖11〗？围而后降者，不赦。夫奉法行令，事上之节也。豨虽旧友，禁可失节乎！”自临，与豨决，陨涕而斩之〖12〗。是时太祖军淳于，闻而叹曰：“豨降，不诣吾而归禁，岂非命耶！”益重禁。﹝一﹞东海平，拜禁虎威将军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160},{"id":"zhangle-q-p004-judgment","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-8b37295d72b16119fb00","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：围而后降，法虽不赦；囚而送之，未为违命。禁曾不为旧交，希冀万一；而肆其好杀之心，以戾众人之议。所以卒为降虏，死加恶谥，宜哉！","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dea6733370b7dd5b47c1","start":0,"end":71}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
